  "name": "Issue 684: Elemental Acuity adds 25% attack power scaling to Runeblade and 5% elemental damage",
  "contract": [
    "Elemental Acuity 706671 (Riftblade passive) reads 'Increases all Fire, Frost, and Nature damage dealt by $s1%",
    "(5%) and adds $s2% (25%) to the attack power scaling of Runeblade.' Effect 0 is aura 79 with school mask 28",
    "(Fire, Nature, Frost), BasePoints 4. Effect 1 is a flat modifier (aura 107), BasePoints 24, on family 38 mask2",
    "0x40000, which only the Runeblade ranks carry, with MiscValue 32: Ascension's private attack power coefficient",
    "operation, outside the 3.3.5a SpellModOp range, which AuraEffect::CalculateSpellMod ignores. A flat private",
    "coefficient modifier adds coefficient points (Cinder and Ashes 707317: flat 25 on op 41 adds 0.25 spell power).",
    "Runeblade's tooltip damage is $m1+$SP*0.3+$AP*0.3 and spell_bonus_data gives 707141 ap_bonus 0.3. Expected:",
    "Runeblade's damage per point of attack power is 0.30 without the talent and (0.30 + 0.25) * 1.05 = 0.5775 with",
    "it; Fire, Frost and Nature spells deal x1.05 and an Arcane spell is unchanged. AP is varied by the fixture aura",
    "980002 (+400 attack power), and the ratio divides the damage change by the measured attack power change.",
    "The caster's own damage-done multiplier (1.11 on the fixture, as in runemaster-primordial-salvos) scales both measurements: 0.30 x 1.11 = 0.333 without the talent, 0.55 x 1.05 x 1.11 = 0.641 with it, and 0.30 x 1.05 x 1.11 = 0.350 if the private coefficient operation is ignored."
  ],
